{{!--
GET /signin
This route of the application will render a view with a sign in form.
The form will contain two inputs, one for the handle and one for the password, and a button to submit the form.
The form will be used to submit a POST request to the /signin route on the server and must have an id of signin-form.
The input for the handle must have both a name and id attribute of "handle" and should be an input type of text.
The input for the password must have both a name and id of "password" and should be an input type of password.
The button will have a name AND id attribute of "submit_button".

You will also have a link on this page that links to /register and has the text "Click here to signup!"
Do not forget to use labels for your inputs.
An authenticated member should not ever see the sign in screen!!!
--}}
